                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Ms. Cassandra,\na customer came in today\nOrdered a mixed bouquet, red\nand white.",
                      "I tried to explain it's bad luck,\nbut he couldn't decide on just\none.",
                      "He seemed a bit off, looked at\nme like I wasn't even there. Then\nhe just left, said he'd be back\nto pick'em up later.",
                      "I just wanted to let you know,\nsince I might be gone by then."
